# Styling and Design Guidelines

## CSS Architecture
- Use Tailwind CSS utility classes as primary styling method
- Use CSS custom properties (CSS variables) for theme values
- Follow the design system defined in [src/styles/globals.css](mdc:src/styles/globals.css)
- Use component-specific CSS only when Tailwind utilities are insufficient

## HOMA Brand Colors
- **Primary Accent**: `#E31E24` (HOMA Red) - Use for primary actions and highlights
- **Secondary Accent**: `#F5E6D3` (HOMA Beige/Cream) - Use for secondary elements
- **Background**: `#fafafa` (Light Gray) - Main background color
- **Text**: `#000000` (Black) - Primary text color
- **Borders**: `#e6e6e6` (Light Gray) - Border color

## Typography
- Use Vazirmatn font family for all Persian text
- Font sizes: H1 (34px), H2 (22px), H3 (20px), H4 (17px), P (17px), Label (15px), Caption (12px)
- Font weights: Bold (700), Semibold (600), Regular (400)
- Line height: 1.5 for all text elements

## Layout and Spacing
- Use consistent spacing scale (4px, 8px, 12px, 16px, 24px, 32px, 48px, 64px)
- Use proper border radius: 26px for cards, 100px for buttons
- Implement proper elevation with shadows: `0px 15px 75px 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18)`
- Use RTL layout for all components

## Component Styling
- Use shadcn/ui components as base and customize with Tailwind
- Implement proper focus states with ring utilities
- Use consistent hover and active states
- Ensure proper contrast ratios for accessibility

## Responsive Design
- Mobile-first approach with responsive breakpoints
- Use Tailwind responsive prefixes (sm:, md:, lg:, xl:)
- Test on various screen sizes and orientations
- Ensure touch-friendly interactive elements (minimum 44px touch targets)